"7d727d435b51b78a6b17f929-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp\u003eWith the founding of XIMB (Xavier Institute of Management Bhubaneswar), XIM University's flagship management institute, in October 1987, history was made. Over the past 36 years, XIMB has been regarded as the nation's top business school. By putting a strong emphasis on research and innovation, it hopes to lead the nation in management education. We consistently score among the top five in the nation for intellectual capital. The New Campus of the XIM University was opened on July 7, 2014, as part of the institution's effort to undertake challenging but necessary activities. Nowadays, it is home to twelve institutions that offer undergraduate, graduate, and doctoral programmes.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch5 style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;Fira Sans\u0026quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eXIM University started admission in various Courses\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cp\u003eMBA\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eB.Tech\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBBM\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eB.Com\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eB.Sc\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMA\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eM.Tech\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch5 style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;Fira Sans\u0026quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eXIM University Application Process\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eFirst of all, Go to the Official website\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://xim.edu.in/\"\u003ehttps://xim.edu.in/\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp; . Then Sign up with an Authentic email and Generate a password. After Successful Registration, you will get a mail and a message on registered mobile.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eNow log in to the website and fill in the required information.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eYou can make online payments through a debit card, credit card, or something else.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eYou can apply for a maximum of 4 different courses at this university.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eAfter adding the required details, you need to scan your photograph into it.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eMake sure that you will fill in the correct information in the given application form.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eYou can make any changes before the payment.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eTake the printed application form and print other documents and submit it to the university address.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch5 style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;Fira Sans\u0026quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eList of Documents\u0026nbsp;\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003ePassport size photograph\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eDate of Birth certificate\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eClass 12th passing certificate\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eClass 10th and 12th mark sheets\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eCategory Certificate\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eCandidates Sign must be Compulsory.\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script type="7d727d435b51b78a6b17f929-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"11:T1205,"])</script><script type="7d727d435b51b78a6b17f929-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp\u003eThe Krishna Vishwa Vidyapeeth \"Deemed To Be University\" in Western Maharashtra, India, is located in Karad amid a backdrop of mountains and valleys. The 57-acre, environmentally friendly complex is well-connected by road, air, and rail. The medical college, which has been around for 35 years, is accredited by the Medical Councils of Malaysia and India and is included in the WHO's Global Directory of Medical Schools. The Medical Council of India recognises MBBS and postgraduate degree/diploma programmes in clinical and fundamental sciences throughout 17 areas. Also, it accepts undergraduate international students from all over the world.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch5 style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;Fira Sans\u0026quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eKrishna Institute Of Medical Sciences University started admission in various Courses\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eMBBS\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eM.D\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eM.Sc\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eB.Sc\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eB.Pharma\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBPT\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMPT\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMDS\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch5 style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;Fira Sans\u0026quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"\u003eAdmission Date Highlights 2023\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\u003ctable class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width: 1025.82px;\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003e\u003ch5 fira=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" color:=\"\" rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0);\"=\"\"\u003eParticular\u003c/h5\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003e\u003ch5 fira=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" color:=\"\" rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0);\"=\"\"\u003eDetails\u003c/h5\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eUniversity\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eKrishna Institute Of Medical Sciences University\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eSeason\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003e2023-24\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eAdmission Open\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eUG, PG \u0026amp; MBBS Course\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eApplication Mode\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eOnline\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eUG Course Last Date to Apply\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eMay 20, 2023\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003ePG Course Last Date to Apply\u0026nbsp;\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eMay 25, 2023\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eMBBS Course Last Date to Apply\u0026nbsp;\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eApril 05,2023\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eM.P.T.H Course\u0026nbsp;Last Date to Apply\u0026nbsp;\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eMay 25, 2023\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eOfficial website\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://kimskarad.in/\"\u003ehttps://kimskarad.in/\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003ch5 style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;Fira Sans\u0026quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eKrishna Institute Of Medical Sciences University Application Process\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eFirst of all, Go to the Official website\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://kimskarad.in/\"\u003ehttps://kimskarad.in/\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;.Then Sign up with an Authentic email and Generate a password. After Successful Registration, you will get a mail and a message on registered mobile.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eNow log in to the website and fill in the required information.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eYou can make online payments through a debit card, credit card, or something else.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eYou can apply for a maximum of 4 different courses at this university.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eAfter adding the required details, you need to scan your photograph into it.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eMake sure that you will fill in the correct information in the given application form.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eYou can make any changes before the payment.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eTake the printed application form and print other documents and submit it to the university address.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch5 style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;Fira Sans\u0026quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eList of Documents\u0026nbsp;\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003ePassport size photograph\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eDate of Birth certificate\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eClass 12th passing certificate\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eClass 10th and 12th mark sheets\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eCategory Certificate\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eCandidates Sign must be Compulsory.\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script type="7d727d435b51b78a6b17f929-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"12:Tef2,"])</script><script type="7d727d435b51b78a6b17f929-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp\u003eLocated within the Sivalik Range of the Himalayan Mountains and far from the busy city life, a fresh place of learning has taken root. Just a few hours away from the popular Kullu resort in Himachal Pradesh, IIT Mandi has been established. Its vision is to become a leading institution in science and technology education while promoting knowledge creation and innovation. This contributes to an India that's moving towards a fair, inclusive, and sustainable society.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ctable class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width: 1025.82px;\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eName of Institute\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eIndian Institute of Technology, Mandi\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eAdmission Open for\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eM.Tech Cources\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eAcademic Year\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003e2025-26\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eAdmission Criteria\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eEntrance Exam/ GATE / COAP based Cut Off\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eMode of Application\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eOnline\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eLast Date to Apply\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eApril 30, 2025\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eLink to Apply\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.iitmandi.ac.in/mtechmsc-admissions\"\u003ehttps://www.iitmandi.ac.in/mtechmsc-admissions\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: inherit; font-family: inherit;\"\u003eM.Tech Course Discipline\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eFluid and Thermal Engineering\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eComputer Science and Engineering\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eElectric Transportation\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ePower Electronics and Drives\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMaterial and Energy Engineering\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMechanical Engineering Specialization in Energy Systems\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBiotechnology\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eStructural Engineering\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch5 style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;Fira Sans\u0026quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eEligibility Criteria\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eCandidate should have a Bachelor Degree in Engineering/ Technology/ M.sc or equivalent degree with minimum 60% marks\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"\u003eAdmission Open, for admission query call/whatsapp +91 9817698000\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch5 style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;Fira Sans\u0026quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eHow to Apply for IIT, Mandi's Online Education Admissions in 2025?\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe actions indicated below should be followed by applicants in order to apply for the courses that offers:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Visit the IIT Mandi official application page at https://www.iitmandi.ac.in/mtechmsc-admissions\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Register yourself by providing a working email address, mobile number, and other information that is needed.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Log in using your registration credentials (received by mail) and complete the application form with all the necessary information.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Submit the application form after paying the requisite application fee.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Save the application form to your computer or print it out for future use.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch5 style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;Fira Sans\u0026quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eList of Documents\u0026nbsp;\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003ePassport size photograph\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eDate of Birth certificate\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eClass 12th passing certificate\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eClass 10th and 12th mark sheets\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eCategory Certificate\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eCandidates Sign must be Compulsory.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"\u003eAdmission Open, for admission query call/whatsapp +91 9817698000\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script type="7d727d435b51b78a6b17f929-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"13:T13db,"])</script><script type="7d727d435b51b78a6b17f929-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe most recent project of a well-known trust in Kolkata, which has been engaged in a variety of activities for more than ten years, is SEACOM SKILLS UNIVERSITY. In order to increase student confidence, the Group has adopted a new strategy for providing engineering and technical education with a strong focus on practical skills and a maximum industry orientation. Experts will be added occasionally as needed to stay up with changing industry and technical needs. In addition to providing high-quality technical education, the institute seeks to foster intellectual growth and business ethics, producing future workers for both the industrial sector and R\u0026amp;D. The Chairman, Mr. Anish Chakraborty, does a good job of overseeing the charity educational Trust.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch5\u003eSeacom Skill University started admission in various Courses\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eBechelor\u0026nbsp; of Law (LLB)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eDoctor of Philosphy (Ph.D)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMaster of Science(M.Sc)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMaster of Hotel Management (MHM)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBachelor of Technology\u0026nbsp; (B.Tech)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMaster of Technology\u0026nbsp; (M.Tech)\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eBechelor of Science (B.Sc)\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch5\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);\"\u003eAdmission Date Highlights 2026\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\u003ctable class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width: 985.818px;\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003e\u003ch5 fira=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" color:=\"\" rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0);\"=\"\"\u003eParticular\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/h5\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003e\u003ch5 fira=\"\" sans\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" color:=\"\" rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0);\"=\"\"\u003eDetails\u003c/h5\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eName of university\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eSeacom Skill University (SSU)\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eAdmission Open\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eUG \u0026amp; PG Offered\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eAcademic Season\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003e2025-26\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eApplication Mode\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eOnline/Offline\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eApplication Process\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eOngoing\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eStart to Application form\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eStarted\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eLast Date to Application form\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e2nd Week Of December 2025\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003eOfficial website\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"line-height: 1.42857;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://www.seacomskillsuniversity.org/\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none;\"\u003ehttps://www.seacomskillsuniversity.org/\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"\u003eAdmission Open : For Admission Inquiry Call/WhatsApp +91 9917698000\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch5 style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;Fira Sans\u0026quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eSeacom Skill University Application Process\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eFirst of all, Go to the Official website\u0026nbsp;\u003ca href=\"https://www.seacomskillsuniversity.org/\"\u003ehttps://www.seacomskillsuniversity.org/\u003c/a\u003e\u0026nbsp;.Then Sign up with an Authentic email and Generate a password. After Successful Registration, you will get a mail and a message on registered mobile.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eNow log in to the website and fill in the required information.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eYou can make online payments through a debit card, credit card, or something else.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eYou can apply for a maximum of 4 different courses at this university.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eAfter adding the required details, you need to scan your photograph into it.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eMake sure that you will fill in the correct information in the given application form.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eYou can make any changes before the payment.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eTake the printed application form and print other documents and submit it to the university address.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch5 style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;Fira Sans\u0026quot;, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"\u003eList of Documents\u0026nbsp;\u003c/h5\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003ePassport size photograph\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eDate of Birth certificate\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eClass 12th passing certificate\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eClass 10th and 12th mark sheets\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eCategory Certificate\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e•\u003cspan style=\"white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003eCandidates Sign must be Compulsory.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"\u003eAdmission Open : For Admission Inquiry Call/WhatsApp +91 9917698000\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); white-space: pre;\"\u003e\t\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e"])</script><script type="7d727d435b51b78a6b17f929-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"14:T1778d,"])</script><script type="7d727d435b51b78a6b17f929-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cspan id=\"docs-internal-guid-cd2209d6-7fff-3c35-b311-decbbeae124f\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eModi Institute of Technology (MIT), established in 2001, is located in Kota, Rajasthan, and is affiliated with Rajasthan Technical University (RTU). The institute offers undergraduate and postgraduate programs in engineering, including B.Tech and M.Tech in various specializations.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eAdmissions to MIT are primarily based on national-level entrance exams followed by centralized counselling processes.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:17pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eModi Institute of Technology Admission Highlights\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left:0pt;\" align=\"left\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border:none;border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ccolgroup\u003e\u003ccol width=\"159\"\u003e\u003ccol width=\"212\"\u003e\u003c/colgroup\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr style=\"height:25pt\"\u003e\u003ctd style=\"border-left:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-right:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-bottom:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-top:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;vertical-align:bottom;padding:2pt 2pt 2pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans