003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e3% for PwD candidates\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e25% for women candidates\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e3% for defence/ex-servicemen dependents\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:17pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eFinal Thoughts\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eModi Institute of Technology is a solid choice for engineering aspirants in Rajasthan, especially those looking for RTU-affiliated colleges. With structured admission through JEE Main and GATE along with centralized counselling, students get a transparent and fair selection process.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eImportant Note\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eCandidates are advised to check the official website of institute and \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://universityfindo.com\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1155cc;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003euniversityfindo.com\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e for the latest updates.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan id=\"docs-internal-guid-c0425d97-7fff-e2f4-1dd3-05fb7b8365f5\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e"])</script><script type="7d727d435b51b78a6b17f929-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"15:T14aa2,"])</script><script type="7d727d435b51b78a6b17f929-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cspan id=\"docs-internal-guid-cd2209d6-7fff-3c35-b311-decbbeae124f\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eMahatma Gandhi Engineering College (MGEC), Jaipur, established in 2008, is a private engineering institute affiliated with Rajasthan Technical University (RTU). The college offers undergraduate engineering programs (B.Tech) and Polytechnic diploma courses in selected disciplines.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eAdmissions at MGEC are based on \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eJEE Main scores and REAP counselling\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e, while diploma courses are offered based on merit in the qualifying examination.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 17pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eAdmission Highlights\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left:0pt;\" align=\"left\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial;\"\u003e\u003ccolgroup\u003e\u003ccol width=\"191\"\u003e\u003ccol width=\"417\"\u003e\u003c/colgroup\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr style=\"height:25pt\"\u003e\u003ctd style=\"border-left:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-right:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-bottom:sol