color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003ePWD (40% or more disability)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"border-left:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-right:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-bottom:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-top:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;vertical-align:bottom;padding:2pt 2pt 2pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e3%\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eAdditional Reservations\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e3% horizontal reservation for PwD\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e25% reservation for women candidates\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e3% for defence/ex-servicemen dependents\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt; background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e5% extra seats for Kashmiri migrants\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 17pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eFinal Thoughts\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eMahatma Gandhi Engineering College, Jaipur, is a good option for students looking for engineering and diploma courses under RTU. With admissions through JEE Main and REAP, the process is transparent and accessible for both national and state-level candidates.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eImportant Note\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003eCandidates are advised to check the official website of institute and \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://universityfindo.com\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003euniversityfindo.com\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"\u003e for the latest updates.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e"])</script><script type="7d727d435b51b78a6b17f929-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"16:T15604,"])</script><script type="7d727d435b51b78a6b17f929-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.92;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eMaharishi Arvind Institute of Engineering \u0026amp; Technology (MAIET), Jaipur, is a well-established institute founded in 1975. The college is affiliated with Rajasthan Technical University (RTU), Rajasthan University of Health Sciences, and approved by the Pharmacy Council of India.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.92;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eMAIET offers a wide range of programs in fields like Engineering, Management, Pharmacy, and Hotel Management at undergraduate and postgraduate levels.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.92;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eAdmissions to most courses are primarily \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003emerit-based\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e, along with entrance exam scores where applicable.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.92;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:17pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eAdmission Highlights 2026\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left:0pt;\" align=\"left\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border:none;border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ccolgroup\u003e\u003ccol width=\"168\"\u003e\u003ccol width=\"447\"\u003e\u003c/colgroup\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr style=\"height:39.25pt\"\u003e\u003ctd style=\"border-left:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-right:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-bottom:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-top:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;vertical-align:bottom;background-color:#ffffff;padding:2pt 2pt 2pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eName of the College\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"border