;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eFill out the application form online\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.92;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003ePay the required registration fee\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.92;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eUpload or submit necessary documents\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.92;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eParticipate in counselling (if applicable)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.92;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eImportant Instructions\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.92;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eCarefully read all guidelines before applying\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.92;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eEnsure all documents are valid and updated\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.92;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eAttend counselling with original documents for verification\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.92;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:17pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eFinal Thoughts\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.92;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eMAIET Jaipur is a good option for students looking for affordable and diverse programs in engineering, management, and pharmacy. With a mix of merit-based and entrance-based admissions, it provides flexibility for students from different academic backgrounds.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.92;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eImportant Note\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.92;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eCandidates are advised to check the official website of institute and \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://universityfindo.com\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1155cc;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003euniversityfindo.com\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e for the latest updates.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan id=\"docs-internal-guid-bc102fe8-7fff-4923-04c6-f4493033cce5\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.92;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script type="7d727d435b51b78a6b17f929-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"17:Tf285,"])</script><script type="7d727d435b51b78a6b17f929-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eMaharani Girls Engineering College (MGEC), Jaipur, established in 2009, is a private engineering institute affiliated with Rajasthan Technical University (RTU). The college is dedicated exclusively to women candidates and offers undergraduate engineering programs in multiple disciplines.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eAdmission to MGEC is based on \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eJEE Main scores followed by REAP counselling\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e, ensuring a transparent and merit-based selection process.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:17pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eAdmission Highlights\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left:0pt;\" align=\"left\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border:none;border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ccolgroup\u003e\u003ccol width=\"185\"\u003e\u003ccol width=\"264\"\u003e\u003c/colgroup\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr style=\"height:25pt\"\u003e\u003ctd style=\"border-left:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-right:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-bottom:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-top:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;vertical-align:bottom;padding:2pt 2pt 2pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eName of the Institute\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"border-left:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-right:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-bottom:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-top:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;vertical-align:bottom;padding:2pt 2pt 2pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u