-type:disc;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eReservation available for:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:circle;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"2\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eSC, ST, OBC, SBC categories\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:circle;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"2\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003ePwD candidates\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:circle;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"2\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eWomen candidates\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:circle;font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"2\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eDependents of defence personnel\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:17pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eFinal Thoughts\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eMaharani Girls Engineering College is a strong option for female students looking to pursue engineering in Rajasthan. With structured admission through JEE Main and REAP, the institute ensures fair opportunities and quality technical education.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eImportant Note\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eCandidates are advised to check the official website of institute and \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://universityfindo.com\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#1155cc;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003euniversityfindo.com\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e for the latest updates.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan id=\"docs-internal-guid-09f84655-7fff-4f03-a7b7-c16c57c1d680\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script type="7d727d435b51b78a6b17f929-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"18:T14681,"])</script><script type="7d727d435b51b78a6b17f929-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eCandidates who appeared for the \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eMHT CET PCB April 25, 2026 Shift 1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e exam can expect a \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003epercentile between 97.00 to 99.50\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e if their score falls in the \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e130–150 marks range\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eBased on early student feedback and previous shifts, the paper was of \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003emoderate difficulty\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e, making this score range highly competitive for top pharmacy and allied health science colleges in Maharashtra.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:17pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eExam Analysis \u0026amp; Difficulty Level\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eRecent exam trends show a balanced paper pattern:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eChemistry\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e (April 22–23 shifts): Mostly direct questions from NCERT/basic textbooks\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eBiology\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e (April 24): Straightforward and scoring\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003ePhysics\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e: Slightly tricky with calculative questions\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ff