ole=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e70–90 marks\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e → 65–85 percentile\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eCandidates with \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e120–130 marks\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e can still get admission in:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eMumbai Educational Trust’s Institute of Pharmacy\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eNDMVP Samanj’s College of Pharmacy\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eGovernment College of Pharmacy, Amravati\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:17pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eStudent Reactions \u0026amp; Competition Trends\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eAs per student discussions:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eCompetition in \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eMay attempt\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e is expected to be slightly higher\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eMarks required may increase by \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e5–10 marks\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e for the same percentile\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eFor high scores (140+), the variation is minimal (\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e~4–6 marks\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eScoring beyond \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e150 marks\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e is considered difficult due to tricky sections\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:17pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eFinal Thoughts\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eScoring \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e130–150 marks in MHT CET PCB 2026\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e puts you in a strong position for admission into top pharmacy colleges. With the right counselling strategy and preference filling, you can secure a seat in reputed institutions.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eImportant Note\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.5;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eCandidates are advised to check the official website of institute and \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://universityfindo.com\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1155cc;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003euniversityfindo.com\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#1155cc;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#4d5156;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003efor the latest updates.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script type="7d727d435b51b78a6b17f929-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"19:T13864,"])</script><script type="7d727d435b51b78a6b17f929-text/javascript">self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eWhistling Woods International (WWI), Mumbai, is one of India’s leading institutes for media, filmmaking, and creative arts. The institute offers a wide range of undergraduate and postgraduate programs in fields like filmmaking, design, media, and communication.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eAdmission to WWI Mumbai is based on entrance exams such as \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eMECAT (Media and Entertainment Common Aptitude Test)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e and \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eCAT (Creative Ability Test)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e, followed by a \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003ePersonal Interview (PI)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e and submission of a \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eStatement of Purpose (SOP)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:17pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eWWI Mumbai Admission 2026: Important Dates\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eWWI conducts entrance exams for different programs across multiple days. The schedule is as follows:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cdiv dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left:0pt;\" align=\"left\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border:none;border-collapse:collapse;\"\u003e\u003ccolgroup\u003e\u003ccol width=\"501\"\u003e\u003ccol width=\"113\"\u003e\u003c/colgroup\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr style=\"height:39.25pt\"\u003e\u003ctd style=\"border-left:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-right:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-bottom:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-top:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;vertical-align:bottom;padding:2pt 2pt 2pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eProgrammes\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"border-left:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-right:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-bottom:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;border-top:solid #cccccc 0.6000000000000001pt;vertical-align:bottom;padding:2pt 2pt 2pt 2pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;text-align: center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eEntrance Exam Date\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr style=\"height:39.25pt\"\