arent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"2\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eSOP submission\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:circle;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"2\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003ePersonal Interview (PI)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:17pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eWI Mumbai Admission Process 2026\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eThe admission process at WWI Mumbai is simple and can be completed online or offline.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:13pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eStep-by-Step Process:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003col style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eFill out the application form\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eAppear for MECAT and CAT entrance exams\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eSubmit Statement of Purpose (SOP)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eAttend Personal Interview (PI)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eFinal selection based on overall performance\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ol\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eAdmissions are conducted under the academic guidance of \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eTata Institute of Social Sciences (TISS)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e, ensuring quality education and industry relevance.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eApplication Fee:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e INR 3,500\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:17pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eStudent Insights on WWI Admission\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eStudents at WWI highlight that the institute offers a strong mix of \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003epractical and theoretical learning\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003e. The curriculum focuses on real-world projects, helping students build industry-ready skills.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eMany students also appreciate:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-inline-start:48px;\"\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eIndustry exposure through guest lectures and workshops\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eNetworking opportunities with professionals\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type:disc;font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\" role=\"presentation\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eCreative learning environment\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eThe admission process is considered straightforward, involving an application form, entrance test, and interview.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:17pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eFinal Thoughts\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:Roboto,sans-serif;color:#333333;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\"\u003eWWI Mumbai stands out as a top choice for students interested in filmmaking, media, and creative arts. With a structured admission process and industry-focused curriculum, it prepares students for successful careers in the entertainme